 *    size  OrderedHashMap  per entry  LinkedHashMap  per entry  LinkedHashMap (compact headers)
 *       0              32                        64                                          56
 *       1             136      136.0            184      184.0                              168
 *      10             208       20.8            544       54.4                              456
 *     100           2,448       24.5          5,104       51.0                            4,296
